<p>Date and place of birth: 25 August 1973, Baku / Azerbaijan</p>
<p>Went missing at the age of 20.</p>
<p>Place of disappearance: Aghdara.</p>
<p><em>For 32 years, there has been no news about his fate&#8230;</em></p>
<p>His mom Mrs.Mahuru says goodbye to the years, living every day in hope of the day she would receive news that Shahin had been found: &#8220;I know that my son will be found&#8221;…</p>
