        'content' => <<<'HTML'
<p>Date and place of birth: 19 June 1959,  Khojaly / Azerbaijan.</p>
<p>Went missing at the age of 33.</p>
<p>Place of disappearance: Khojaly.</p>
<p><strong><em>          </em></strong><em>For 33 years, there has been no news about his fate&#8230;</em></p>
<p>His wife Ms.Parvana: “We could not accept his absence, we waited for him, hoping    that we would receive some news, we comforted our children by telling them that their father would return, but our hopes were dashed, and now we are waiting for the day when their remains will be found,” she says…</p>
HTML,
